# Live trading state and raw market-data dumps stay local.
#
# data/portfolio.json and data/trades.json hold real positions and realised
# P&L — personal financial records that do not belong in a git history.
# data/cache and data/runs hold raw API responses and per-run audit records;
# they are the local audit trail, kept on disk, not published.
#
# universe/tsx-universe.json IS committed: it is derived reference data with no
# personal content, and pinning it means a backtest run months from now
# resolves the same contracts as the run that produced the gate result.
data/cache/
data/runs/
data/portfolio.json
data/trades.json
